Fail-closed Android cell lifecycle transaction

Usage: droidloom-supervisor <COMMAND>

Commands:
  identity-inspect      Inspect actual dedicated identity grants without reserving or starting a cell
  plan                  Render the complete construction and reverse teardown plan as JSON
  development-inspect   Inspect readable boot inputs without root or any cell activation
  development-validate  Validate the inputs for the minimal first-boot cell (requires root)
  development-run       Start the minimal first-boot cell and attach to Android init logs
  help                  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
